 <div class="customer-profile sub-nav-bar w-clearfix"><a class="add sub-nav-button w-button" href="#">&nbsp; <strong>Charge</strong></a><a class="import sub-nav-button w-button" href="#">&nbsp; <strong>Create subscription</strong></a><a class="sub-nav-button w-button" href="#"> &nbsp;<strong>Add to&nbsp;list</strong></a>
  </div>
  <div class="customer-profile dashboard-body">
